    "level": "permission",
    "note": "The steel tower is locked and sits on land granted by a private landowner. The register says you can climb the stairs to a viewing platform just below the cab, but no administrator source says whether visitors may use it. Ask the Colville Indian Reservation administrators before visiting."
  },
